siness_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QLUUaTj034zYVWiVl9tNvA","review_id":"LRIQ4hR33oBPiNKJgT0v4A","date":"2018-08-10T01:12:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9224693775177002,"text_excerpt":"We walked over to this cafe from the Le Pavillion Hotel on a Tuesday morning. The place was almost empty which scared us a bit, but fear was unwarranted. Service was prompt and friendly. Our breakfast was delicious, but I have to mention the biscuits and gravy. The gravy was out of this world!!!! What a fantastic cheat meal! We asked how it was made and apparently they use andouille sausage in it. I couldn't stop eating it. The rest of our breakfast was good, too, but the gravy just rocked my world. After breakfast, we took a stroll through nearby Lafayette Park. Nice morning!"},{"business_id":"QLUUaTj034zYVWiVl9tNvA","review_id":"RFtlXEnGDVALhoesXznzMg","date":"2018-12-04T21:46:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.921766996383667,"text_excerpt":"Cafe at the Square has been my go-to lunch spot for years! It's in such a convenient location at the corner of St. Charles and Poydras and the food is consistently delicious; literally in years of eating here I've never encountered an \"off day\". I'd go through the list of things you should try, but I love them all so all you have to do is look at the menu--I will say this...GET THE MOZZARELLA CROQUETTES! Trust me, just get them and you can thank me later. The specials tend to rotate, but you can check them out online before you go in, or just wait to be surprised and read them on the board when you get there. Whatever you order, make sure you get yourself a side of ranch, because it's hom..."},{"business_id":"QLUUaTj034zYVWiVl9tNvA","review_id":"E4oCHccaJyZ2BVFTPSJG8A","date":"2013-03-25T14:52:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.920163631439209,"text_excerpt":"When in NOLA we are always looking for a place for a good breakfast that doesn't have us waiting in line forever. After our first two choices failed us- we used the YELP app to find out that we were almost in front of Cafe at the Square. A couple of steps and we were quickly seated at a table. Cute place with windows that look out onto the street and the nearby park. Connected to a hotel- I wasn't optimistic about how good the food was going to be- but they pleasantly surprised me. The coffee was quite good and the food came up fresh and hot. I ordered an omelet and it was quite good. Perfectly prepared- I didn't want the toast so they substituted a fruit cup for me which was nice. Anothe..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QLUUaTj034zYVWiVl9tNvA","photo_id":"GkEgXqWnTHen5VN5ZuqPsw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GkEgXqWnTHen5VN5ZuqPsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9119943380355835},{"business_id":"QLUUaTj034zYVWiVl9tNvA","photo_id":"F7fkzozj3kNPLLrNKlF6bQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F7fkzozj3kNPLLrNKlF6bQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8745760321617126},{"business_id":"QLUUaTj034zYVWiVl9tNvA","photo_id":"SEX8UbhHcrPwDhwASXv1gQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SEX8UbhHcrPwDhwASXv1gQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8631090521812439},{"business_id":"QLUUaTj034zYVWiVl9tNvA","photo_id":"WZGjlucmEpW_vbwtYg40LA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WZGjlucmEpW_vbwtYg40LA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8087283968925476}]},"notebook_case":null}
